  "power.neoorigins.wraith_evolved_phase.description": "切換：相位時可穿過實體方塊並飛行。飢餓消耗減少25%。黑曜石和基岩仍會阻擋你。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_weakness_aura.name": "恐懼氣場",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_ascended_weakness_aura.description": "3格內的附近敵人受到虛弱影響。",
