  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_phase.description": "切換：相位時可穿過除基岩外的所有方塊並飛行。飢餓消耗極小。沒有什麼能困住你。",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_hunger_drain.name": "穩定形態",
  "power.neoorigins.wraith_apex_hunger_drain.description": "你的幽靈形態已穩定 —— 飢餓消耗僅比正常快25%。",
  "origins.neoorigins.skeleton.name": "骷髏",
  "origins.neoorigins.skeleton.description": "復活的一袋骨頭 —— 迅捷、輕盈，持弓致命。身軀脆弱，避開陽光，且只能消化最汙穢的食物。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_undead.name": "亡靈",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_undead.description": "你是亡靈。治療藥水傷害你，傷害藥水治療你，亡靈殺手附魔對你造成額外傷害。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_water_breathing.name": "空心肺",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_water_breathing.description": "不需要呼吸。可以在水下無限期生存。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_marksmanship.name": "槍法",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_marksmanship.description": "使用彈射武器時+2額外傷害。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_speed.name": "骨輕",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_speed.description": "你中空的骨骼使你的腳步快20%。",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_jump.name": "輕盈",
  "power.neoorigins.skeleton_jump.description": "跳躍比正常高30%。",
